      "pageStart": 5,
      "pageEnd": 5,
      "target": "../sections/sec-011-note.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "Notes are in light green boxes with a green left border and with a \"Note\" header in green. Notes are always informative.\nThis section is non-normative.\nThis document uses the following terms as defined in external specifications and defines terms specific to JSON-LD.\nTerms imported from ECMAScript Language Specification [ECMASCRIPT], The JavaScript Object Notation (JSON) Data Interchange Format\n[RFC8259], Infra Standard [INFRA], and Web IDL [WEBIDL]\narray\nIn the JSON serialization, an array structure is represented as square brackets surrounding zero or more values. Values are separated by com",
