    {
      "id": "library/w3c-2020-json-ld-1-1/blocks/prose-sec-030",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "JSON-LD 1.1 Processing Mode",
      "pageStart": 19,
      "pageEnd": 20,
      "target": "../sections/sec-030-411-json-ld-11-processing-mode.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "New features defined in JSON-LD 1.1 are available unless the processing mode is set to json-ld-1.0. This may be set through an API option. The\nprocessing mode may be explicitly set to json-ld-1.1 using the @version entry in a context set to the value 1.1 as a number, or through an API\noption. Explicitly setting the processing mode to json-ld-1.1 will prohibit JSON-LD 1.0 processors from incorrectly processing a JSON-LD 1.1\ndocument.\nThe first context encountered when processing a document which contains @version determines the processing mode, unless it is defined\nexplicitly through an API opt",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "not-summarised"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/w3c-2020-json-ld-1-1/blocks/prose-sec-031",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "Note",
      "pageStart": 20,
      "pageEnd": 20,
      "target": "../sections/sec-031-note.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "Setting the processing mode explicitly to json-ld-1.1 is RECOMMENDED to prevent a JSON-LD 1.0 processor from incorrectly processing a\nJSON-LD 1.1 document and producing different results.\nThis section is non-normative.\nAt times, all properties and types may come from the same vocabulary. JSON-LD's @vocab keyword allows an author to set a common prefix which\nis used as the vocabulary mapping and is used for all properties and types that do not match a term and are neither an IRI nor a compact IRI (i.e., they\ndo not contain a colon).\nIf @vocab is used but certain keys in an map should not be exp",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "not-summarised"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/w3c-2020-json-ld-1-1/blocks/prose-sec-032",
