      "content": "Input\nExample 38: Aliasing keywords\nCompacted (Input) \nExpanded (Result) \nStatements \nTurtle Open in playground\n{\n  \"@context\": {\n    \"url\": \"@id\",\n    \"a\": \"@type\",\n    \"name\": \"http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/name\"\n  },\n  \"url\": \"http://example.com/about#gregg\",\n  \"a\": \"http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Person\",\n  \"name\": \"Gregg Kellogg\"\n}",
