      "target": "../sections/sec-082-51-expanded-document-form.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "Expansion is the process of taking a JSON-LD document and applying a context so that the @context is no longer necessary. This process is\ndescribed further in § 5.1 Expanded Document Form.",
