      "content": "Input\nExample 147: Embedding JSON-LD containing HTML in HTML\nCompacted (Input) \nExpanded (Result) \nTurtle\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"http://schema.org/\",\n  \"@type\": \"WebPageElement\",\n  \"name\": \"Encoding Issues\",\n  \"description\": \"Issues list such as unescaped &lt;/script&gt; or --&gt;\"\n}\n</script>",
